      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": [
        {
          "Label": "UNLABELLED",
          "content": "We present a case of 63-year-old male with hypertension and hyperlipidaemia, who was an athlete in the \"masters category\". Because of interaction between amlodipine and simvastatin, in combination with physical activity, the patient reported: muscle pain, weakness of the muscles, dizziness, and confusion. After amlodipine and simvastatin discontinuation, all symptoms resolved rapidly."
        },
        {
          "NlmCategory": "CONCLUSIONS",
          "Label": "CONCLUSIONS",
          "content": "(1) Concomitant use of several drugs by elderly individual patients, the risk of drug--physical activity interactions may occur."
        }
      ]},
